{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26649","headline":"金州书事寄山中旧友 · 姚合","name":"金州书事寄山中旧友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"安康虽好郡，刺史是憨翁。\n买酒终朝饮，吟诗一室空。\n自知爲政拙，衆亦觉心公。\n亲事星河在，忧人骨肉同。\n簿书岚色里，鼓角水声中。\n井邑神州接，帆樯海路通。\n野亭晴带雾，竹寺夏多风。\n溉稻长洲白，烧林远岫红。\n旧山期已失，芳草思何穷。\n林下无相笑，男儿五马雄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26649.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26649","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}